{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月24日，<strong>月之暗面Kimi今日凌晨正式推出Kimi K3.1系列首個模型——K3.1 Pro。</strong>這是公司迄今能力最強的3萬億級參數模型，支持100萬上下文。高速版Kimi K3.1 Pro Highspeed同步推出，同等智能下輸出速度約為2至3倍。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583658.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:21:21.423809+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:15:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_hash":"7f71577736f1c5ea63f11d1d2781a769b519c0b1e4f45338eb6d152a09a983f3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}